te",通知设置:"Notification settings",邀请链接已生成:"Invite link created",邮箱:"Email",配置:"Settings",重命名:"Rename",重命名项目:"Rename project",重新支付:"Try payment again",限量:"Limited","项目由 oil-oil 创建于 3 天前，":"Created by oil-oil 3 days ago; ",高级设置:"Advanced settings","\uD83C\uDF89 限时 5 折！！":"\uD83C\uDF89 50% off for a limited time!","\uD83D\uDCCE 设计稿.sketch":"\uD83D\uDCCE design-file.sketch","\uD83D\uDD0D 搜索你感兴趣的内容…":"\uD83D\uDD0D Search topics you are interested in…","，查看":" See ","，":", ","。":".","！":"!","？":"?","：":": ","；":"; ","（":"(","）":")","《":"","》":"","【":"[","】":"]","--force 会重写远程分支历史":"--force can rewrite remote branch history","37 个文件、一周的改动放入同一提交":"37 files and a week's work in one commit","Push 后核对远端分支和最新 Commit":"After pushing, verify the remote branch and latest commit","ZIP 包含工作文件，但不包含 .git 目录和提交历史":"A ZIP includes working files, not the .git directory or commit history","clone 三份后，难以确认哪个目录最新":"After three clones, it is hard to tell which folder is current","clone 后应先执行 npm install，再运行项目":"After cloning, run npm install before starting the project","clone 默认获取可达的提交历史":"A clone gets the reachable commit history by default","fork 在托管平台复制，clone 下载到本地":"Fork copies on the hosting platform; clone downloads locally","git add 选择改动":"git add selects changes","git commit 写入历史":"git commit writes history","git diff 查看改动":"git diff shows changes","git log 无法运行":"git log cannot run","git pull 无法恢复从未提交到 Git 的本地改动":"git pull cannot restore local changes never committed to Git","main 包含同一错误":"main has the same bug","pull 后有 3 个文件变化":"3 files changed after pull","⑂ 新建分支2":"⑂ New branch 2","● 修复按钮在手机上错位":"● Fix button misalignment on mobile","● 修改 index.html":"● Update index.html","● 完成首页导航栏":"● Finish the home-page navigation","● 改了 style.css":"● Update style.css","☁️ 空的":"☁️ Empty","✓ 已上传":"✓ Uploaded","两侧均有新提交，合并后生成 merge commit":"Both sides have new commits; merging creates a merge commit",两台设备通过远程仓库同步提交:"Two devices sync commits through the remote repository","两边改了同一行，两版都摆着等你选":"Both sides changed the same line; choose between the two versions","之后 pull 增量":"Then pull incremental updates","仓库会保持合并中状态，后续操作前应先完成或中止合并":"The repository stays in a merge state; finish or abort it before continuing","使用 feature/功能名，便于识别用途":"Use feature/feature-name so its purpose is clear",保留冲突标记可能导致代码无法解析:"Leaving conflict markers can make code unparsable",修复按钮在手机上错位:"Fix button misalignment on mobile","先确认本地改动，再同步远程":"Confirm local changes before syncing with the remote",冲突尚未处理:"Conflicts are unresolved","分支长期不与主线同步，会增加后续合并冲突":"A branch that stays out of sync with main causes more merge conflicts later",初始化项目:"Initialize project",删除双方内容可能移除原有功能:"Deleting both sides can remove existing functionality","刷新 GitHub，最新提交已出现":"Refresh GitHub—the latest commit is there",功能分支仍存在错误:"The feature branch still has an error","只 commit 而不 push，远程仓库不会保存这些提交":"If you commit without pushing, the remote repository does not have those commits","只 commit 而不 push，远程副本不会包含这些提交":"If you commit without pushing, the remote copy does not include those commits","合并后未运行检查，错误会随发布进入正式环境":"If you skip checks after merging, errors can reach production","名称未说明用途，后续难以区分分支":"A vague name makes branches hard to distinguish later","后续：获取并整合远程更新":"Next: fetch and integrate remote updates",回退时难以只撤销其中部分改动:"It is hard to roll back only part of the change","团队通常让 main 保持经过验证、可继续发布的状态":"Teams usually keep main verified and ready to release",在你的账号下创建仓库副本:"Create a repository copy under your account",完成首页导航栏:"Finish the home-page navigation","实验提交先留在分支；删除前确认已合并或确实不再需要":"Keep experimental commits on the branch; before deleting, confirm they are merged or truly unnecessary","密钥一旦推送到远程仓库，即使删除提交也要按泄露处理":"Once a secret is pushed to a remote repository, treat it as exposed even if the commit is deleted","工作目录更新为 main 分支对应的文件版本":"The working directory is updated to main's file version","已在 GitHub 上公开可见":"Publicly visible on GitHub","拉取后也可能发生冲突，需要手动解决":"Pulling can also cause conflicts that need manual resolution","拿更新不用重新 clone":"You do not need to clone again to get updates","改了哪些文件 Git 自己会记，说明要写做了什么":"Git records which files changed; the message should say what you did","未保存到 Git 历史的改动不会被取回":"Changes not saved in Git history cannot be recovered","未提交改动可能阻止切换，或在切换后仍保留在工作目录":"Uncommitted changes can block a switch or remain in the working directory afterward",未检查改动:"Changes not reviewed","未验证的改动合入 main，会增加发布风险":"Merging unverified changes into main raises release risk","未验证的较大改动进入 main，会增加协作和发布风险；可通过历史提交恢复":"Large unverified changes in main increase collaboration and release risk; history can restore them",本地仍是旧版本:"Local is still on the old version","查看并选择改动后，再创建提交":"Review and select changes before creating a commit","标题：小狸的主页":"Title: Xiaoli's home page","标题：小狸的摄影主页":"Title: Xiaoli's photography home page","每行显示一条提交：短哈希值和说明":"Each row shows one commit: a short hash and message","没有原仓库写入权限时，应 fork 到自己的账号后推送":"Without write access to the original repository, fork it to your account before pushing","目标分支没有新提交，可快进到功能分支":"The target branch has no new commits, so it can fast-forward to the feature branch","移除冲突标记并提交后，冲突才会解决":"Conflicts are resolved only after removing markers and committing","第一次 clone 整仓":"First clone of the full repository",线上报错:"Production error",继续修改可能覆盖协作者已经完成的工作:"Continuing to edit may overwrite work a collaborator already finished","绿色 Code 按钮，复制 HTTPS 地址":"Use the green Code button to copy the HTTPS address",编辑最终内容:"Edit final content","设备 A \uD83D\uDCBB push":"Device A \uD83D\uDCBB push","设备 B \uD83D\uDCBB pull":"Device B \uD83D\uDCBB pull","说明提交完成的工作，便于识别":"Describe the completed work so the commit is identifiable",远程分支上已有的提交可能被重写:"Existing commits on the remote branch may be rewritten","远程分支已有本地缺少的提交；先获取并整合更新，再推送":"The remote branch has commits missing locally; fetch and integrate them before pushing","长期不同步远端，会扩大分支差异并增加合并冲突":"Staying out of sync with the remote widens branch differences and increases merge conflicts","队友已推 12 个新提交":"A teammate pushed 12 new commits","首次：复制工作文件与仓库历史":"First: copy working files and repository history","\uD83D\uDCBB 本地 ●●●●":"\uD83D\uDCBB Local ●●●●","\uD83D\uDCC1 my-first-page-最新":"\uD83D\uDCC1 my-first-page-latest","（没有输出，工作区干净）":"(No output; working tree clean)","#11 fix: 手机端导航换行":"#11 fix: mobile navigation wrapping","#12 feat: 深色模式":"#12 feat: dark mode",'+ &lt;button class="btn btn-primary"&gt;立即开始&lt;/button&gt;':'+ &lt;button class="btn btn-primary"&gt;Get started&lt;/button&gt;',"+ &lt;nav&gt;新导航&lt;/nav&gt;":"+ &lt;nav&gt;New navigation&lt;/nav&gt;","+ 立即开始":"+ Get started","- &lt;button&gt;点我&lt;/button&gt;":"- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;","- &lt;nav&gt;…整个导航栏…&lt;/nav&gt;":"- &lt;nav&gt;…entire navigation bar…&lt;/nav&gt;","- 点我":"- Click me",".env 已推送到远程。":".env was pushed to the remote.",".env 已提交，之后才添加 .gitignore 规则…":".env was committed before the .gitignore rule was added…","47 files changed，未经过逐项检查":"47 files changed, without reviewing each one",": On main: 首页改动尚未完成":": On main: home-page changes are unfinished",": WIP on main: a1b2c3d 首页基础版本":": WIP on main: a1b2c3d home-page baseline","AI 修改 feat/nav 导航":"AI updates feat/nav navigation","AI 修改 feat/pricing 定价页":"AI updates feat/pricing page","AI 完成修改":"AI finished the changes","Git 仍保留该工作目录的注册信息":"Git still retains this working directory's registration","HEAD is now at a1b2c3d 首页基础版本":"HEAD is now at a1b2c3d home-page baseline","PR 是 GitHub 的网页功能，不是命令":"A PR is a GitHub web feature, not a command","Saved working directory and index state On main: 首页改动尚未完成":"Saved working directory and index state On main: home-page changes are unfinished","WIP on main: 三周前":"WIP on main: 3 weeks ago","commit 提交记录":"commit records a revision","feat/dark-mode 已推送到远程":"feat/dark-mode was pushed to the remote","feat: 首页加上深色模式":"feat: add dark mode to the home page",'git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m "AI 修改"':'git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m "AI changes"',"git diff 逐行检查":"git diff for a line-by-line review",'git stash push -m "首页改动尚未完成"':'git stash push -m "home-page changes are unfinished"',"hotfix/login \xb7 修复登录问题":"hotfix/login \xb7 fix sign-in issue","main \xb7 首页改动尚未提交":"main \xb7 home-page changes not committed","node_modules 占用 380MB，未出现在待提交列表中":"node_modules uses 380 MB and is not in the pending list","① 立即到服务平台":"① Go to the service platform now","② 使用 BFG / filter-repo":"② Use BFG / filter-repo","● 修正样式":"● Fix styles","● 完成修改":"● Finish changes","● 调整实现":"● Adjust implementation","一个 PR 包含三个功能，评审范围过大":"One PR contains three features, making the review scope too large",个人项目也可保留带说明的改动记录:"Personal projects can keep documented change records too",临时调试代码被一并提交:"Temporary debugging code was committed too","仅查看文件列表，无法确认各行的具体改动":"A file list alone cannot confirm the exact line changes","使用描述性名称，便于识别保存的改动":"Use descriptive names to identify saved changes",修复完成后重新实现了此前的改动:"The earlier change was reimplemented after the fix","先保留 stash，确认恢复正确后再 drop":"Keep the stash first; drop it after confirming the restore is correct","共有 8 条记录，最早创建于上个月":"There are 8 records; the earliest was created last month","出现问题后，难以确认具体改动":"When something breaks, it is hard to identify the exact change",删除当前文件不会移除历史提交中的敏感内容:"Deleting the current file does not remove sensitive content from historical commits","删除范围包含页脚，需要确认是否符合预期":"The deletion includes the footer; confirm that is intended",匹配规则且尚未跟踪的文件会被忽略:"Untracked files matching the rule are ignored","右键 → 移到废纸篓":"Right-click → Move to Trash",同一个分支同时只能在一个目录工作:"The same branch can work in only one directory at a time","在提交前通过 diff 移除调试代码":"Use diff to remove debugging code before committing","密钥保留在本地，不提交到远程仓库":"Keep secrets local; do not commit them to the remote repository","将 7 条中间提交整理为 1 条主分支提交":"Squash 7 intermediate commits into 1 main-branch commit","已移除链接工作目录，仅保留主工作目录":"Removed the linked working directory; only the main one remains","已跟踪文件不受 .gitignore 影响，需要 git rm --cached":"Tracked files are unaffected by .gitignore; use git rm --cached","当前分支：hotfix/login":"Current branch: hotfix/login",忽略全部文件会使新增页面无法进入版本控制:"Ignoring all files keeps new pages out of version control","怎么验证：切换右上角开关":"How to verify: toggle the switch in the upper-right corner","执行 pop 前先确认当前分支":"Confirm the current branch before running pop","提交说明：":"Commit message:","改了什么：导航栏 + 卡片支持深色":"What changed: dark-mode support for navigation and cards",明确比较最近两个提交:"Explicitly compare the two most recent commits","未恢复已有 stash，造成重复工作":"An existing stash was not restored, causing duplicate work","未按项目约定整理历史，后续追溯会更困难":"History was not organized by project convention, making later tracing harder","未提交改动阻止切换分支，需要先处理这些改动":"Uncommitted changes block switching branches; handle them first",未清理的工作目录会占用磁盘并增加维护成本:"An uncleaned working directory takes disk space and adds maintenance cost","标题与说明过于笼统，难以理解改动范围":"The title and description are too vague to understand the scope","模板库：github.com/github/gitignore":"Template library: github.com/github/gitignore","每个目录对应独立分支，改动不会互相覆盖":"Each directory has an independent branch, so changes do not overwrite one another","每次保存生成一条记录，最新记录编号为 0":"Each save creates a record; the newest record is numbered 0",清理历史:"Clean up history",确认改动符合预期后再提交:"Commit after confirming the changes meet expectations","窗口 A":"Window A","窗口 B":"Window B","红色表示删除，绿色表示新增；显示尚未 add 的改动":"Red means deleted and green means added; shows changes not yet added","缺少说明，无法快速确认记录内容":"Without a description, the record's contents are hard to confirm quickly",轮换或吊销密钥:"Rotate or revoke the secret",长期不整理会增加识别每条记录用途的难度:"Leaving history unorganized makes each record's purpose harder to identify",首页改动尚未完成:"Home-page changes are unfinished","首页改动已应用到 hotfix/login 分支":"Home-page changes were applied to hotfix/login","\uD83D\uDD12 仅保留在本地":"\uD83D\uDD12 Keep local only","- 本周上线":"- Launch this week","\xb7 本周上线":"\xb7 Launch this week","\xb7 周日休息":"\xb7 Rest on Sunday","“找出最近 7 天注册的用户”":'"Find users who signed up in the last 7 days"',"（多条错误输出）":"(multiple error messages)","&lt;a&gt; 链接":"&lt;a&gt; Link","&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;文字&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;":"&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;","&lt;body&gt; 页面可见内容":"&lt;body&gt; visible page content","&lt;div&gt; 卡片":"&lt;div&gt; card","&lt;h1&gt; 标题":"&lt;h1&gt; heading","&lt;head&gt; 标题、编码等元数据":"&lt;head&gt; metadata such as the title and character encoding","&lt;head&gt; 欢迎来到我的网站":"&lt;head&gt; Welcome to my website","&lt;p&gt; 段落":"&lt;p&gt; paragraph","# 发布计划":"# Launch plan","# 周报 **完成**：首页改版 - 修 bug":"# Weekly update **completed**: home-page redesign - bug fixes","→ 转发给同事 / 截图发群":"→ Forward to a teammate / share a screenshot in the group chat","↗ 链接":"↗ Link","▲ 编译失败":"▲ Build failed","▶ 视频":"▶ Video","● 改了下":"● Made a few changes","☁️ 克隆项目":"☁️ Clone project","☁️ 平台设置页":"☁️ Platform settings","☁️ 自动重新上线":"☁️ Automatically redeploy","⚙ 构建命令 / 输出目录填错":"⚙ Wrong build command / output directory","✎ 手动改":"✎ Edit manually","⟳ 刷新页面后，该内存数据通常会丢失":"⟳ This in-memory data is usually lost when the page refreshes","\uD83D\uDCBB 本地 .env":"\uD83D\uDCBB Local .env","\uD83D\uDCBB 本地仓库":"\uD83D\uDCBB Local repository","\uD83D\uDCC4 源码":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Source code","\uD83D\uDCCA 用户表.xlsx":"\uD83D\uDCCA users.xlsx","\uD83D\uDCE6 仓库重建":"\uD83D\uDCE6 Rebuild from the repository","\uD83D\uDCE6 dist 成品":"\uD83D\uDCE6 dist build output","\uD83D\uDD25 Firebase \xb7 文档":"\uD83D\uDD25 Firebase \xb7 documentation","\uD83D\uDDD1 删除":"\uD83D\uDDD1 Delete","1,024 行记录，已删除":"1,024 records deleted","1&nbsp;&nbsp;│ 小狸 │ 深圳":"1&nbsp;&nbsp;│ Riley │ Shenzhen","2&nbsp;&nbsp;│ 阿机 │ 杭州":"2&nbsp;&nbsp;│ Avery │ Hangzhou","401 Unauthorized（仍在使用旧 Key）":"401 Unauthorized (still using the old key)",按钮用蓝色:"Use blue buttons","本地配置一行一个；敏感值不要提交、截图或转发":"Keep one local setting per line. Do not commit, screenshot, or forward sensitive values.","本地与线上环境分别配置，避免混用凭证和地址":"Configure local and production environments separately to avoid mixing credentials and URLs.","笔记.md → 另存为 笔记.docx":"notes.md → Save as notes.docx","标签交叉嵌套，浏览器会按容错规则重排":"The tags overlap improperly; the browser may rearrange them during error recovery.",查:"Read","纯文本兼容多种编辑器，便于长期保存和查看":"Plain text works in many editors, making it easy to save and review over time.",打开网页:"Open page","大量可重新安装的依赖进入仓库，应由 .gitignore 排除":"A large number of reinstallable dependencies entered the repository; .gitignore should exclude them.","代码读取变量名；替换配置值通常无需修改代码":"Code reads the variable name, so you can usually change the configuration value without changing code.","当前目录没有 package.json；请先进入项目目录":"There is no package.json in this directory. Move into the project directory first.","都是托管服务，但数据模型和查询方式不同":"Both are managed services, but their data models and query methods differ.","端口 \xb7 权限 \xb7 启动 \xb7 备份":"Ports \xb7 permissions \xb7 startup \xb7 backups",多数服务需重启或重新部署后才会读取新的环境变量:"Most services load new environment variables only after a restart or redeploy.",发布计划:"Launch plan","发一个网址，对方用浏览器就能看":"Send a URL and anyone can view it in a browser.",改:"Update",改动出现问题时可以回到之前的提交:"If a change causes trouble, you can return to an earlier commit.","改了 .env，直接刷新页面…":"Changed .env, then just refreshed the page…","改文案只动中间的字，别碰尖括号":"To edit the copy, change only the text in the middle—not the angle brackets.","根据 package.json 和锁文件安装项目依赖":"Install project dependencies from package.json and the lockfile.","关闭窗口会丢失当前输出；请先记录首条错误和执行命令":"Closing the window loses the current output. Record the first error and command first.",后续命令的结果难以归因:"It becomes hard to tell which command caused later results.","后续内容可能仍处于该元素内…":"The content that follows may still be inside this element…","价格　　　\xa5199":"Price　　　\xa5199","结构无效，浏览器可能按容错规则把内容移到 body":"The structure is invalid; the browser may move the content into body during error recovery.",进入项目目录:"Enter the project directory","可用自然语言说明目标，再审查 AI 生成的 SQL":"Describe the goal in plain language, then review the SQL AI generates.","库存　　　42 件":"In stock　　　42","连续粘贴多条命令…":"Pasting several commands at once…","两人同时保存，互相覆盖":"Two people save at the same time and overwrite each other.",列出当前目录内容:"List the contents of the current directory","没有定位原因就增加依赖，会扩大冲突和维护范围":"Adding dependencies before finding the cause broadens the conflict and maintenance surface.","没有可用备份时，删除可能无法恢复":"Without a usable backup, deletion may be irreversible.",每个稳定小步都可以成为一次提交:"Each stable small step can be a commit.",每完成一个可验证的小步就记录一次:"Record each small step once you can verify it.",密钥会进入远程提交历史:"The secret enters remote commit history.","目标聊天框不解析 Markdown，# 和 ** 会原样显示":"The target chat box does not parse Markdown, so # and ** appear literally.",爬山:"Hiking","配置了仓库、分支和构建规则后，匹配的 push 才会触发发布":"After repository, branch, and build rules are configured, only matching pushes trigger deployment.","匹配规则的未跟踪文件会被跳过；已跟踪文件要另行处理":"Untracked files that match the rule are skipped; tracked files need separate handling.",平台给的网址能换成自己的域名:"You can replace the platform URL with your own domain.","平台没找到正确产物，先看构建日志和项目文档":"The platform could not find the right build output. Check the build log and project docs first.","清楚的标题、重点、图片和章节":"Clear headings, highlights, images, and sections","清单：装了哪些包、能跑哪些命令":"Manifest: which packages are installed and which commands can run","清单和锁文件在，可按项目配置重新安装依赖":"With the manifest and lockfile, dependencies can be reinstalled from the project configuration.","缺少 &lt;/div&gt; 会使 DOM 结构与预期不一致":"A missing &lt;/div&gt; makes the DOM structure differ from what you expect.",缺少结束反引号会使后续内容被解析为代码块:"A missing closing backtick makes the following content parse as a code block.",让读者快速扫到真正关心的内容:"Help readers quickly scan for what matters to them.",删:"Delete",删除项目目录会同时丢失本地历史:"Deleting the project directory also loses local history.",失败:"Failed",首页要吸顶导航:"The home page needs a sticky navigation bar","说明含义不清，之后难以定位版本":"The message is unclear, making the version hard to identify later.","提交到仓库的密钥可能出现在提交历史、克隆副本或构建产物中":"A secret committed to the repository may appear in history, clones, or build artifacts.",填写表单:"Fill out form",通过文件或截图分享可能暴露其中的敏感值:"Sharing the file or a screenshot may expose sensitive values in it.","图片 404":"Image 404",维护范围尚未评估:"Maintenance scope not yet assessed","未理解错误就加 sudo，可能绕过保护并删除错误目标":"Adding sudo before understanding an error can bypass safeguards and delete the wrong target.","未做线上验收，资源路径和环境变量问题可能影响正式页面":"Without production verification, asset paths and environment variables may break the live page.",我的第一个页面:"My first page",我喜欢爬山:"I like hiking","下面是正文，却也成了代码":"The body text below also became code","先确认项目目录和脚本，再逐条执行":"Confirm the project directory and scripts, then run commands one at a time.","先找第一条可操作错误，并保留命令与上下文":"Find the first actionable error and keep the command and context.","写进前端代码后，访问者可能直接读取":"Once written into frontend code, visitors may read it directly.",新品发布报告:"New product launch report","行是记录、列是字段，像 Excel 一样看":"Rows are records and columns are fields, much like a spreadsheet.",需求:"Requirements","许多聊天产品会把 Markdown 风格文本渲染成标题和列表":"Many chat products render Markdown-style text as headings and lists.","选择时核对静态托管能力、权限、配额和计费规则":"When choosing, check static-hosting support, permissions, quotas, and billing rules.","选择自托管前，先确认部署和维护成本":"Before choosing self-hosting, confirm the deployment and maintenance cost.","页面可提供媒体、链接和表单等交互元素":"A page can provide interactive elements such as media, links, and forms.","页面主体由这类嵌套的 HTML 元素组成":"The page body is made of nested HTML elements like these.",一份给人看的项目报告:"A project report for people to read","依赖和脚本声明丢失，其他环境无法按项目配置重建":"Dependency and script declarations are missing, so other environments cannot rebuild from the project configuration.",以更高权限执行:"Run with elevated privileges","用标题和列表表达需求，便于 AI 识别层级":"Use headings and lists to express requirements so AI can recognize the hierarchy.",用户数据存在页面变量里:"User data lives in page variables.","右键 → 查看网页源代码":"Right-click → View page source","元素可嵌套，形成页面的层级结构":"Elements can nest to form the page hierarchy.",远程仓库保留另一份提交记录:"The remote repository keeps another copy of the commit history.",运行方法:"How to run",增:"Create","长时间没有提交记录，难以恢复稳定版本":"Without commits for a long time, it is hard to restore a stable version.","这是静态前端的常见流程；有些平台从源码构建或启动服务":"This is a common static-site workflow; some platforms build from source or start a service.","重新安装依赖时，这类本地改动通常会被替换":"When dependencies are reinstalled, local changes like these are usually replaced.",周六:"Saturday",周末计划:"Weekend plan","逐条执行并确认结果，便于定位失败步骤":"Run each command and confirm its result so you can pinpoint the failed step.","注册=增、列表=查、改资料=改、注销=删":"Sign up = create; list = read; edit profile = update; cancel = delete","转换可能改变 Markdown 结构或转义部分符号":"Conversion may change Markdown structure or escape some characters.","add 选择改动":"add selects changes","commit 记录版本":"commit records a version","DOCX 不是 HTML；浏览器不会将其作为网页结构解析":"DOCX is not HTML; browsers do not parse it as page structure.","Error: 网络超时":"Error: network timeout","Excel 不是多人在线数据库":"Excel is not a multiuser online database.","file:// 指向本机文件，不等同于可供他人访问的部署地址":"file:// points to a local file, not a deployed address others can access.","HTML 把内容变成阅读体验":"HTML turns content into a reading experience.","id │ 名字 │ 城市":"id │ name │ city","index.html → 另存为 .docx":"index.html → Save as .docx","init 初始化":"init initializes the project","localhost 是你自己电脑，别人打不开":"localhost is your own computer; no one else can open it.","Markdown 负责写，HTML 负责呈现":"Markdown is for writing; HTML is for presentation.","Markdown 会合并连续空格；请使用表格或列表排版":"Markdown collapses consecutive spaces; use a table or list for layout.","scripts 里写好的快捷命令":"Convenient commands defined in scripts","? 仍未定义":"? Still undefined","“高级会员”":'"Premium member"','{ "name": "小林" }':'{ "name": "Jordan" }','{ "name": "小林", "plan": "Pro" }':'{ "name": "Jordan", "plan": "Pro" }',"✓ 目录更整齐":"✓ Cleaner folder structure","✓ 已保存":"✓ Saved","✕ 缺失":"✕ Missing","1 分钟":"1 minute","1 个接口 \xb7 1 张表":"1 endpoint \xb7 1 table","1,280 万行 DEBUG":"12.8 million DEBUG lines","10 秒后超时":"Times out after 10 seconds","10,000 次尝试":"10,000 attempts","12 个服务 \xb7 6 个队列":"12 services \xb7 6 queues","12,480 行被删除":"12,480 rows deleted","200 成功":"200 success","201 成功":"201 success","3 行，被噪音盖住":"3 lines, buried in noise","42 \xb7 小林":"42 \xb7 Jordan","500 失败":"500 failure",安全会话:"Secure session",按钮:"Button","把表结构一起交给 AI":"Give AI the table schema too","把输入直接拼进 SQL":"Concatenate input directly into SQL",保存:"Save",保存订单:"Save order",本月调用:"Calls this month","必填 \xb7 邮箱格式":"Required \xb7 email format",变量与函数:"Variables and functions",并发:"Concurrency",不包含密钥:"No secrets included",不是把电脑页面等比例缩小:"It is not simply a scaled-down desktop page.",不同语言不能直接混写:"Different languages cannot be mixed directly.",不推荐:"Not recommended",不要把内部报错丢给用户:"Do not show internal errors to users.",不要擅自修改关键数据:"Do not silently change critical data.","不要在里面放密码、令牌等敏感信息":"Do not put sensitive information such as passwords or tokens in it.",部署:"Deployment","部署成功 ≠ 已经安全":"Deployment succeeded ≠ the app is secure",部署平台:"Deployment platform","参数不会被当作另一段 SQL 执行":"The parameter is not executed as another piece of SQL.",参数缺失和服务失败也应有明确响应:"Missing parameters and service failures also need clear responses.",操作结果:"Result",查询:"Query",超时:"Timeout",成功:"Success",成熟方案提供常见认证能力:"A mature solution provides common authentication capabilities.",创建用户:"Create user",从单条日志上升到监控:"Turn individual logs into monitoring",错误:"Error","错误率 8.2%":"8.2% error rate",错误要指向具体字段:"Errors should point to the specific field.",打印错误后仍返回成功:"Log an error but still return success",代码运行:"Code execution","单列 \xb7 大按钮":"Single column \xb7 large buttons",当前环境:"Current environment",当前项目:"Current project",当前用户:"Current user","登录 Cookie 的常见保护":"Common protections for login cookies",登录表单:"Login form",登录不代表能看所有数据:"Signing in does not mean you can view all data.",第一版:"First version",点击后:"After clicking","电脑 1440px":"Desktop 1440px",调试日志淹没真正的问题:"Debug logs bury the real problem","调用 AI 模型":"Call an AI model",订单已创建:"Order created",动画和阴影可以等流程能用以后再补:"Add animation and shadows after the flow works.","都使用 JavaScript / TypeScript，切换成本较低":"Both use JavaScript / TypeScript, so switching costs less.",读取:"Read",读取数据:"Read data",读取用户:"Read user","端点名称无法清楚表达其读取、修改或删除行为":"The endpoint name does not clearly express whether it reads, updates, or deletes.",短时函数:"Short-lived function",多人项目:"Multi-person project",额外增加:"Extra addition",发送到浏览器的代码和配置不应包含服务端密钥:"Code and configuration sent to the browser must not contain server secrets.",发送通知:"Send notification",返回结果:"Return result",方法和动作相反:"Method and action conflict","方法说明动作，路径说明对象":"The method describes the action; the path identifies the resource.",访问他人账单:"Access someone else's bill",放在哪:"Where it goes",服务端撤销:"Server revokes it",服务端检查:"Server check",服务端日志:"Server log","服务器 + 数据库":"Server + database",该邮箱不存在:"That email does not exist",改本地变量不能证明身份:"Changing a local variable does not prove identity.",改完再提交:"Update before submitting",告警:"Alert",更换语言不能替代对数据库查询和索引的优化:"Changing languages cannot replace optimizing database queries and indexes.","构建页面 + API":"Build page + API",关键规则在服务端再算一遍:"Recalculate critical rules on the server.",管理操作留下记录:"Record administrative actions",管理密钥进入前端包:"Admin secret enters the frontend bundle",规模决定约束:"Scale determines the needed conventions",规则不同:"Different rule","规则集中在一份 Schema":"Keep rules together in one schema",规则检查:"Rule check","过去 5 分钟":"Past 5 minutes",过早设计:"Premature design",函数上限:"Function limit",后端:"Backend",后端仍需校验:"Backend still needs validation",后端验密码:"Backend checks password",后端重算:"Backend recalculates",画面:"Visual",环境变量:"Environment variables","换成 NestJS":"Switch to NestJS",会话有效:"Session valid",获得网址:"Get a URL",获取管理密钥的人可能绕过应用层权限访问或修改数据:"Anyone with an admin secret may bypass application-level permissions to access or modify data.","价格 -99":"Price -99","价格 99":"Price 99","价格必须大于 0":"Price must be greater than 0",价格和权限应由后端基于可信数据重新核对:"The backend should recheck prices and permissions against trusted data.","检查 admin":"Check admin",检查库存:"Check inventory",建立会话:"Create session","角色之外，还要看资源关系":"Beyond roles, check the relationship to the resource.",脚本不可读:"Scripts cannot read it",教程版本与项目版本不一致:"Tutorial version does not match the project version","接口数据 → 页面内容":"API data → page content",结果:"Result",解释影响几行:"Explain how many rows are affected",旧教程:"Old tutorial",看到成功:"See success","看起来像按钮，但没有行为":"Looks like a button, but does nothing",可持续猜密码:"Password guessing can continue","可由平台托管运行环境，仍需管理配置、监控和成本":"The platform can host the runtime, but you still manage configuration, monitoring, and cost.",控制台修改:"Console change",框架:"Framework",框架不能替你决定业务:"A framework cannot decide the business for you.","浏览历史 \xb7 访问日志 \xb7 分享截图":"Browser history \xb7 access logs \xb7 shared screenshots",浏览器里的值可以被修改:"Values in the browser can be changed.",浏览器中的用户操作:"User actions in the browser",路径:"Path","路由、插件和错误处理各管一套":"Routes, plugins, and error handling each use a separate system.","没有动态数据或服务端能力需求时，应评估后端是否必要":"If you do not need dynamic data or server-side capabilities, consider whether a backend is necessary.","没有请求 \xb7 没有提示":"No request \xb7 no feedback",没有删除按钮:"No delete button","没有有效会话 \xb7 401":"No valid session \xb7 401",每次敏感操作都经过权限判断:"Every sensitive action goes through an authorization check.",每日汇总:"Daily summary",每天:"Every day","密码 / 验证码":"Password / verification code",密码不能明文入库:"Passwords cannot be stored in plain text.",密钥放平台设置:"Put secrets in platform settings",敏感信息出现在网址里:"Sensitive information appears in the URL",明确开放:"Explicitly allow","模板能启动，但请求流程说不清":"The template starts, but the request flow is unclear.",默认:"Default","默认拒绝，按需开放":"Deny by default; allow as needed",频繁切换而未完成完整流程:"Switching frequently without completing a full workflow","平台专用 API 过多会提高迁移或重构核心规则的成本":"Too many platform-specific APIs raise the cost of migrating or refactoring core rules.",前端:"Frontend",前端把机器数据整理成人能读懂的界面:"The frontend turns machine data into an interface people can understand.",前端传来:"Sent by frontend",前端很容易把失败当成功:"The frontend can easily mistake failure for success.",前端声明的身份可以伪造:"An identity claimed by the frontend can be forged.",前端与函数一起部署:"Deploy frontend and functions together","前端只提交一次，并接收最终结果":"The frontend submits once and receives the final result.",前端资源可被浏览器获取:"Frontend assets are accessible to the browser",请求:"Request","请求从哪进？":"Where does the request enter?",请求体:"Request body",区域:"Region",权限:"Permission",权限规则:"Authorization rule",权限检查:"Authorization check",缺少恢复提示:"No recovery guidance","缺少请求、动作、对象和原因":"Missing the request, action, object, and reason",缺少限速的登录接口:"Login endpoint without rate limiting","确认 1 行":"Confirm 1 row","让 AI 交代上下文":"Have AI explain the context",任务时间超过函数上限:"Task exceeds the function time limit","日志不能代替重试、回滚或失败响应":"Logs cannot replace retries, rollbacks, or failure responses.",日志中不能记录敏感信息:"Logs must not record sensitive information.",三套状态库:"Three state libraries",三种参数放在不同位置:"Put the three parameter types in different places",删除:"Delete",删改前先预览影响范围:"Preview the impact before deleting or changing data",商品价格:"Product price",上线前先看平台限制:"Check platform limits before launch","尚未用任一语言完成登录、数据库和部署流程":"You have not completed login, database, and deployment in any one language yet.","少了 WHERE 的删除":"Deletion without WHERE","谁处理？":"Who handles it?",谁调用:"Who calls it",身份服务:"Identity service",失败提示不泄露账号状态:"Failure messages do not reveal account status","实例 A 内存":"Instance A memory","实例 B 内存":"Instance B memory",视觉完成不等于功能完成:"A finished visual does not mean the function works.",视频转码:"Video transcoding","适合短小、事件驱动的任务":"Good for short, event-driven tasks",收到输入:"Receive input","手机 390px":"Mobile 390px",输出:"Output",输入:"Input",输入框:"Input field",输入框下方:"Below the input",输入校验:"Input validation",输入只作为数据:"Treat input only as data","数据库 / 存储":"Database / storage",数据库查询:"Database query",数据库失败:"Database failure","数据库泄露后，明文存储的密码会直接暴露":"If the database leaks, plaintext passwords are exposed immediately.","数字 \xb7 大于 0":"Number \xb7 greater than 0","双列 \xb7 完整导航":"Two columns \xb7 full navigation",提交:"Submit",提交表单:"Submit form",填写邮箱:"Enter email",跳过表单:"Skip form","同一功能，两种屏幕":"One feature, two screen sizes",同一规则散落多处:"The same rule is scattered across several places",团队经验:"Team experience",推荐:"Recommended",退出要让凭证真正失效:"Signing out must actually invalidate credentials.",退款规则:"Refund rules",忘了检查:"Forgot to check",未确认条件就在生产库执行写操作:"Run a write operation in production without confirming the conditions",文章作者:"Post author",系统擅自改成:"System silently changes it to",下一次请求可能换实例:"The next request may use a different instance",先保证关键流程:"Make the key flow work first",先查当前版本的官方文档:"Check the current version's official docs first",先单独验证接口:"Test the endpoint by itself first",先画清最小请求流程:"Map the smallest request flow first","先会语言，再学框架":"Learn the language before the framework","先看现实条件，再选语言":"Check real constraints before choosing a language",先跑通官方最小示例:"Get the official minimal example working first",先完成一条请求流程:"Finish one request flow first",先学会读数据:"Learn to read data first",先沿用项目结构:"Follow the existing project structure first",先在测试数据或事务中验证:"Verify first with test data or in a transaction",先找到真正的慢点:"Find the actual bottleneck first",现有项目:"Existing project",限制跨站携带:"Limit cross-site sending","响应从哪出？":"Where does the response leave?",响应内容:"Response body","小林 \xb7 Pro 会员":"Jordan \xb7 Pro member","小型 API":"Small API",校验:"Validate",校验通过才写数据库:"Write to the database only after validation passes",写入数据库:"Write to database",写数据库:"Write database",新代码放进团队已经熟悉的位置:"Put new code where the team already knows to find it.",需登录:"Sign-in required",需要保留的数据应该写入数据库或缓存:"Data that must persist should go into a database or cache.",需要确认身份并保存数据:"Need to verify identity and save data",选定一门:"Choose one",沿用已经熟悉的语法:"Use syntax you already know","业务逻辑被平台 API 包住":"Business logic is wrapped in platform APIs",页面:"Page",页面价格:"Page price",页面检查可以被绕过:"Page-side checks can be bypassed",页面提示:"Page message",页面显示:"Page display","页面应该显示：暂时无法保存，请稍后重试":"The page should say: Unable to save right now. Please try again later.",页面应根据操作进度和结果提供清晰反馈:"The page should provide clear feedback about progress and results.","一次提交，由后端串起步骤":"One submission, with the backend chaining the steps",一个端点包办一切:"One endpoint handles everything",一个简单页面:"A simple page",一条端点要写清四件事:"Every endpoint should define four things",一条可定位的日志:"A traceable log entry",一条请求穿过三套框架:"One request passes through three frameworks",一眼看清字段规则:"See field rules at a glance","依赖越多，安装、升级和排错越复杂":"More dependencies make installation, upgrades, and debugging more complex.",已登录:"Signed in",已通知值班人员:"On-call staff notified",异步与错误:"Async code and errors",隐藏按钮不等于接口安全:"Hiding a button does not secure the endpoint.",应该:"Should be","应该 403":"Should be 403",应明确拒绝并让用户确认:"Reject it clearly and ask the user to confirm.",影响:"Impact","用 request id 串起一次请求":"Use a request ID to connect one request",用户和开发者看到不同层次:"Users and developers see different levels of detail","用户看到的是产品，不是语言":"Users see the product, not the language.",用户输入:"User input",语言不会自动让界面更好用:"A language does not automatically make an interface easier to use.","预计 10 分钟":"Estimated 10 minutes","允许 / 拒绝":"Allow / deny",允许编辑:"Edit allowed","再次请求 401":"Request again: 401","暂时无法保存，请重试":"Unable to save right now. Please try again.",怎么验:"How to verify",展示文字不能代替稳定字段:"Display text cannot replace stable fields",账号或密码错误:"Incorrect account or password",这条日志无法帮助排错:"This log does not help with debugging",真正错误:"Actual error",真正需要:"Actually needed",支付回调:"Payment webhook",执行:"Run",直接请求:"Direct request","直接请求 API":"Request API directly",只存:"Store only",只设计成功分支:"Design only the success path",只有文字和图片的介绍页:"A brochure page with only text and images","只走 HTTPS":"HTTPS only",状态放到外部服务:"Keep state in an external service",状态码与结果互相矛盾:"Status code and result contradict each other",准备执行:"About to run","自动化、数据和 AI 库通常更丰富":"Automation, data, and AI libraries are usually richer.","API 返回":"API response","ERROR 出错了":"ERROR Something went wrong","Express \xb7 少量目录":"Express \xb7 few folders","Git 仓库":"Git repository","JWT 内容通常可以解码查看":"JWT contents can usually be decoded and viewed.","main.js \xb7 浏览器可获取":"main.js \xb7 accessible to the browser","NestJS \xb7 明确模块":"NestJS \xb7 clear modules","Node.js 后端":"Node.js backend","Python 的常见生态":"Common Python ecosystem","Python 后端":"Python backend","users 表":"users table",跳到主要内容:"Skip to main content","键盘用户按 Tab 后先看到它":"Keyboard users see this first after pressing Tab",品牌色:"Brand colors","项目计划.pdf":"Project Plan.pdf","先让用户看懂，再让用户行动。":"Help people understand first, then take action.","搜索 \xb7 下载 \xb7 关闭":"Search \xb7 Download \xb7 Close",文件已经同步:"File synced",图标含义不清楚:"The icon’s meaning is unclear","删除项目藏在“更多”里":"Delete project is hidden under More","三个下载图标，风格各不相同":"Three download icons with inconsistent styles","2 分钟产品演示":"2-minute product demo","第 3 课：设置权限":"Lesson 3: Set permissions","08:40 \xb7 中文字幕 \xb7 已看 60%":"08:40 \xb7 English captions \xb7 60% watched",我们为什么做这款产品:"Why we built this product",关键操作步骤:"Key steps",视频下方同时提供文字说明和字幕:"Provide written instructions and captions below the video",页面一打开就突然播放声音:"Audio starts playing as soon as the page opens","没有封面、时长，也没有失败提示":"No thumbnail, duration, or error message",加载失败:"Couldn’t load","内容不变，只换展示方式":"The content stays the same; only the view changes","选项较少，文案简短易扫读":"A small set of short labels is easy to scan","选项过多会压缩单项宽度，标签难以快速扫读":"Too many options squeeze each label and make scanning harder","提交才生效的话，单选框更直白":"If it only takes effect on submit, radio buttons are clearer","只有两个状态，开关更顺手":"For two states, a switch is easier to use","如何重置密码？":"How do I reset my password?","支持哪些支付方式？":"Which payment methods are supported?","将次要信息收起，缩短页面长度":"Collapse secondary details to shorten the page","⚠ 账号存在风险，请立即处理":"⚠ Your account may be at risk. Take action now.","关键提示默认折叠，用户进入页面时看不到内容":"A critical notice is collapsed by default, so people miss it on arrival","只有一组内容时，不需要增加展开步骤":"One content group doesn’t need an extra expand step","已签收 \xb7 今天 14:32":"Delivered \xb7 Today, 14:32","运输中 \xb7 昨天 09:15":"In transit \xb7 Yesterday, 09:15","已下单 \xb7 前天 20:02":"Order placed \xb7 2 days ago, 20:02","oil-oil 通过了审批":"oil-oil approved the request","林小hu 提交了审批":"Alex Chen submitted the request",创建了审批单:"Created the approval request","v2.4 新增暗色模式":"v2.4 added dark mode","v2.3 修复 12 个问题":"v2.3 fixed 12 issues","v2.2 上线协作功能":"v2.2 launched collaboration",部署成功:"Deployment successful","构建中…":"Building…",测试失败:"Tests failed",今天开周会:"Weekly meeting today",中午一起吃饭:"Lunch together at noon","和时间先后无关，普通列表就行":"There’s no time sequence here; a regular list works","内容没有先后关系，不适合使用时间轴":"The items have no sequence, so a timeline doesn’t fit","节点内容太重，用卡片平铺":"The nodes are too dense; use cards instead","\uD83D\uDCC1 设计资源":"\uD83D\uDCC1 Design assets","\uD83D\uDCC4 首页.sketch":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Home.sketch","\uD83D\uDCC4 图标.sketch":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Icons.sketch","\uD83D\uDCC1 素材库":"\uD83D\uDCC1 Asset library","\uD83C\uDFE2 某某科技":"\uD83C\uDFE2 Acme Tech",页面权限:"Page permissions","没有父子层级，列表就够":"There’s no parent-child hierarchy, so a list is enough","多级缩进压缩内容宽度，节点名称被截断":"Deep indentation narrows the content and truncates names","默认全部展开，节点关系难以扫读":"With everything expanded by default, relationships are hard to scan",夏季新品发布会:"Summer product launch","第 2 步 \xb7 邀请团队成员":"Step 2 \xb7 Invite team members",左右切换看不同角度:"Switch left and right to see different angles","内容数量保持克制，带指示点和箭头":"Keep the number of slides modest and include dots and arrows","重要公告只放在靠后项，未切换的用户看不到":"A key announcement is buried in a later slide that many people never reach","内容较多却缺少当前位置提示，用户无法判断浏览进度":"Without a position indicator, people can’t tell how far they’ve browsed","4 个入口挤进轮播，得翻 4 次":"Four destinations crammed into a carousel mean four swipes","表单里塞轮播，填写被打断":"A carousel in a form interrupts completion",这里还没有任何数据:"There’s no data here yet",还没有项目:"No projects yet",新建项目:"Create project","\uD83D\uDD0D 搜索关键词":"\uD83D\uDD0D Search keywords",狼人杀:"Werewolf","没有找到相关内容，换个关键词试试":"No matches found. Try a different keyword.","收件箱是空的——邮件都处理完了 \uD83C\uDF89":"Your inbox is empty — you’re all caught up \uD83C\uDF89","用户：然后呢？我该怎么办？":"User: What now? What should I do?","其实是网络错误，却被当成空的":"It’s actually a network error, but it looks empty","空空如也～":"Nothing here yet",插画比内容还抢眼:"The illustration steals attention from the content","→ 点击":"→ Click",放大预览:"Enlarge preview",加载失败时显示占位和说明:"Show a placeholder and explanation when loading fails","容器是方的，图是宽的，裁切填充不变形":"The container is square and the image is wide; crop to fill without distortion","强制拉伸宽高，图片比例失真":"Forcing the dimensions stretches the image out of proportion","大量图片同时加载，会明显阻塞页面响应":"Loading many images at once noticeably slows the page","新品发布会 \xb7 限时 5 折":"Product launch \xb7 50% off for a limited time","文字只存在于图片中，搜索和读屏无法读取":"Text that exists only in an image can’t be searched or read by screen readers","缺少 alt，加载失败后无法说明图片内容":"Without alt text, there’s no description if the image fails to load","价格 ↑":"Price ↑",键盘:"Keyboard",鼠标:"Mouse",官网改版:"Website redesign",年报设计:"Annual report design",搜索用户名:"Search usernames",新建用户:"Create user",管理员:"Admin","就一行数据，表头比内容还重":"With one row of data, the header outweighs the content",新品发布:"New product launch","图和段落挤进格子，全变形了":"Images and paragraphs crammed into cells become distorted",负责人:"Owner","列太多，手机上得一直左右滑":"Too many columns force constant horizontal scrolling on mobile","层级关系只靠缩进表示，父子归属不清楚":"Indentation alone makes parent-child relationships unclear",评论者提交了一条评论:"A reviewer left a comment",协作者发出项目邀请:"A collaborator sent a project invite","如何用 AI 规划官网内容":"How to plan website content with AI","作者、阅读量与统计时间":"Author, views, and reporting date",设计系统落地指南:"A guide to rolling out a design system","首页 Banner 终稿":"Final homepage banner","图标库 v3":"Icon library v3",账号与安全:"Account & security",图片全被压成细长条:"The images are all squashed into thin strips",唯一的一条数据:"The only record","只有一条记录时，列表结构没有必要":"A list structure isn’t necessary for a single record",无线耳机:"Wireless headphones",机械键盘:"Mechanical keyboard",销售额:"Revenue",订单数:"Orders",年度总结报告:"Annual summary report","长文已经自成内容区，额外卡片边界会干扰阅读":"Long-form content already forms its own section; an extra card boundary interrupts reading",外层卡片:"Outer card",内层卡片:"Inner card",整页唯一的内容也要套个框:"Even the page’s only content is boxed in",在线:"Online",离开:"Away",待付款:"Awaiting payment",待发货:"Awaiting shipment","有 3 条新动态":"has 3 new updates",前端任务:"Frontend tasks",设计任务:"Design tasks","红点是“有未读”，不是分类色":"A red dot means unread, not a category color","每项都显示红点，无法区分真正需要关注的内容":"If every item has a red dot, nothing stands out as needing attention",评论者名称:"Reviewer name",经授权的评论内容:"Authorized comment content",协作者人数与展示范围:"Collaborator count and display scope","前端工程师 \xb7 深圳":"Frontend engineer \xb7 Shenzhen","未上传头像时，可使用名称首字":"Use a name initial when no avatar is uploaded","只有头像没有姓名，无法辨认成员":"An avatar without a name doesn’t identify the member","横向插画裁成圆形后，主体两侧被截断":"Cropping a landscape illustration into a circle cuts off both sides",证件照被圆形裁掉半张脸:"A circular crop cuts off half the face in an ID photo",我的主页:"My profile",我的文章:"My posts","自己的页面，脸出现四次":"On one person’s page, their face appears four times",订单号:"Order ID",金额:"Amount",已发货:"Shipped",环境:"Environment",域名:"Domain","工单 #1024":"Ticket #1024",提交人:"Submitted by","就一个字段，写句话的事":"It’s one field — a sentence would do","长段落塞进右栏，读不动":"A long paragraph crammed into the right column is hard to read",活跃用户:"Active users",本周新增:"New this week",流失率:"Churn rate",当前在线:"Online now",距秒杀结束:"Flash sale ends in",本月总结:"This month’s summary",完成任务:"Tasks completed",获得好评:"Positive ratings","展示了不必要的小数位，反而影响快速理解":"Unnecessary decimal places make it harder to understand at a glance",服务可用性:"Service availability","用户只想知道“正常”还是“故障”":"People only need to know whether it’s normal or down","正在保存设置…":"Saving settings…","⚠ 2 处填写有误，请检查后重试":"⚠ 2 fields need attention. Check them and try again.","\uD83D\uDCE2 本周六 02:00-04:00 系统维护，期间暂不可用":"\uD83D\uDCE2 Scheduled maintenance this Saturday, 02:00–04:00. The service will be unavailable.","⚠ 删除后不可恢复，操作前请确认已备份":"⚠ This can’t be undone. Make sure you have a backup before deleting.","ⓘ 当前是未发布草稿，仅自己可见":"ⓘ This is an unpublished draft, visible only to you","✓ 保存成功":"✓ Saved successfully","一句话的成功，用不着一直挂着":"A one-line success message doesn’t need to stay on screen","⚠ 删除需要明确确认":"⚠ Deletion needs an explicit confirmation","⚠ 密码即将过期":"⚠ Your password will expire soon","⚠ 有 3 条未读公告":"⚠ You have 3 unread announcements","ⓘ 新功能已上线":"ⓘ A new feature is now available","\uD83C\uDF89 限时 5 折！马上升级会员":"\uD83C\uDF89 50% off for a limited time! Upgrade now.",新评论:"New comment","「这个方案我觉得可以」":"“This approach looks good to me.”","查看 →":"View →",导出完成:"Export complete","1,024 条数据已导出":"1,024 records exported","下载文件 →":"Download file →",系统公告:"System announcement","v2.4 已发布，新增深色模式":"v2.4 is out with dark mode","更新日志 →":"Release notes →",已保存:"Saved","一句话的事，用不着通知":"A simple save doesn’t need a notification",任务详情:"Task details","确认删除？":"Confirm deletion?","共 3 条记录":"3 records total","确认删除这条记录？":"Delete this record?","确认移出成员「林小hu」？":"Remove Alex Chen from the team?","清空全部输入？":"Clear all inputs?","确认删除全部 1,024 条数据？此操作不可恢复！":"Delete all 1,024 records? This can’t be undone!",删除全部:"Delete all",确定删除:"Delete permanently","删除后，项目下的文件、成员和配置都会被清除，且无法通过任何方式恢复，请确认你已经备份好重要数据。":"Deleting this project permanently removes its files, members, and settings. Make sure important data is backed up.","\uD83D\uDCA1 支持拖拽调整排序":"\uD83D\uDCA1 Drag to reorder",悬停我:"Hover over me",知道了:"Got it","再确认一次？":"Confirm one more time?","查看主页 →":"View profile →",筛选状态:"Filter status",快捷键:"Keyboard shortcuts","⌘S 保存 \xb7 ⌘P 发布":"⌘S Save \xb7 ⌘P Publish","查看全部 →":"View all →",帮助中心:"Help center","查看全部 24 篇 →":"View all 24 articles →","真实内容是个表单，骨架和布局对不上":"The actual content is a form, but the skeleton doesn’t match its layout","请求已失败，骨架屏却没有切换为错误状态":"The request failed, but the skeleton never changed to an error state",提交成功:"Submitted successfully","审核结果将在 1-3 个工作日内通知你":"You’ll be notified of the review result in 1–3 business days",返回列表:"Back to list",查看详情:"View details",支付成功:"Payment successful","\xa5 299.00 \xb7 订单号 20260721001":"\xa5299.00 \xb7 Order #20260721001",支付失败:"Payment failed","余额不足，请更换支付方式":"Insufficient balance. Please use a different payment method.",重新支付:"Try payment again",昵称已更新:"Nickname updated","就改了一个字，也用了一整页":"One changed word doesn’t need a whole page","后续操作过多，缺少明确优先级":"Too many next actions, with no clear priority",再提交:"Submit again",">一<":">Mon<",">二<":">Tue<",">三<":">Wed<",">四<":">Thu<",">五<":">Fri<",">六<":">Sat<",">日<":">Sun<","vibe coding 入门":"vibe coding basics","vibe 设计规范":"vibe design guidelines"," coding 入门":" coding basics"," 设计规范":" design guidelines","搜索组件…":"Search components…",最近搜索:"Recent searches",日期选择器:"Date picker",表单校验:"Form validation","⌘ 新建":"⌘ New","➕ 新建项目":"➕ New project","\uD83D\uDCC4 新建文档":"\uD83D\uDCC4 New document","\uD83D\uDCC1 新建文件夹":"\uD83D\uDCC1 New folder",深圳s:"Shenzhenx","错误值仍能提交，会影响后续统计":"Invalid values can still be submitted, affecting later reporting","技术中心 / 前端组":"Engineering / Frontend","技术中心 ▸":"Engineering ▸","平台研发 ▸":"Platform Engineering ▸",前端组:"Frontend","数码电器 ▸":"Electronics ▸","手机通讯 ▸":"Phones & Communications ▸",智能手机:"Smartphones","广东省 / 深圳市 / 南山区":"Guangdong / Shenzhen / Nanshan","回显完整路径，选了哪一目了然":"Show the full path so the selection is unmistakable","数据只有一层，不需要增加二级菜单":"The data has one level, so it doesn’t need a second menu","广东省 / 深圳市 / ":"Guangdong / Shenzhen / ","广东省 / 广州市 / ":"Guangdong / Guangzhou / ","研发部 \xd72":"Engineering \xd72","☑ 研发部":"☑ Engineering","☑ 前端组":"☑ Frontend","☐ 后端组":"☐ Backend","☐ 设计部":"☐ Design","☑ 服饰":"☑ Apparel","☑ 男装":"☑ Men’s clothing","☑ 衬衫":"☑ Shirts","☐ 数码":"☐ Electronics","☑ 家居":"☑ Home","跨大类勾了 3 个分类":"Three categories selected across unrelated departments","→ 自动带上整个分支":"→ Automatically includes the whole branch","研发部 \xd7":"Engineering \xd7","前端组 \xd7":"Frontend \xd7","后端组 \xd7":"Backend \xd7","研发部 / ":"Engineering / ","设计部 / ":"Design / ",体验组:"Experience","只想看看组织结构，却被要求先选一项":"You only want to view the org chart, but you’re forced to select something","城市间没有父子关系，层级是硬编的":"Cities have no parent-child relationship; this hierarchy is artificial","2026 年 7 月":"July 2026",选个预约日:"Choose an appointment date",过去的日子不可选:"Past dates can’t be selected","最近 7 天":"Last 7 days","最近 30 天":"Last 30 days","手输的日期，格式和日子都能错":"A manually entered date can have both an invalid format and an invalid day","仅需粗粒度范围时，完整日历增加操作成本":"For a broad range, a full calendar adds unnecessary effort",营业时间:"Business hours",自动同步数据:"Sync data automatically","每 30 分钟一档，不会选出 09:17":"30-minute increments prevent choosing 09:17","需要具体时刻时，还应提供日期":"When an exact time matters, include the date too",上午:"Morning",下午:"Afternoon",晚上:"Evening","选「上午」而已，分钟级面板太重":"Choosing “Morning” doesn’t need a minute-by-minute panel",下午三点:"3:00 PM","解析失败：请输入 HH:mm":"Couldn’t parse. Enter a time as HH:mm",跨时区安排应明确标注时区:"Cross-time-zone schedules should clearly show the time zone","⬆ 把文件拖到这里，或点击选择":"⬆ Drag files here, or click to choose","\uD83D\uDCC4 需求文档.pdf":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Requirements.docx","\uD83D\uDCC4 设计稿.fig":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Design.fig","⬆ 点击或拖拽上传":"⬆ Click or drag to upload","支持 JPG / PNG，单个不超过 10MB":"JPG and PNG supported, up to 10 MB each",视频链接:"Video URL","⬆ 上传":"⬆ Upload","用户手里只有一个 URL，给个输入框就行":"If people only have a URL, a text field is enough","大量小文件逐个上传，耗时且难以管理进度":"Uploading many small files one by one takes time and makes progress hard to manage","\uD83D\uDCC4 视频素材.mp4":"\uD83D\uDCC4 Video footage.mp4","✕ 失败":"✕ Failed","缺少重试入口，失败后需要重新上传":"Without a retry option, people must upload again after failure","\uD83C\uDFAC 成片-4K.mp4（1.8GB）":"\uD83C\uDFAC Final cut-4K.mp4 (1.8 GB)","传到 99% 才提示超出大小限制":"The size limit isn’t reported until the upload reaches 99%","✕ 邮箱格式不正确":"✕ Invalid email format",搜索表单:"Search form","输入关键词…":"Enter keywords…",单个搜索字段不需要额外的表单结构:"One search field doesn’t need extra form structure","大量字段集中在一页，填写负担过高":"Too many fields on one page make the form burdensome","提交失败：密码至少 8 位":"Submission failed: password must be at least 8 characters","规则提前不说，提交才报错":"The rule is hidden until submission fails","只读信息塞输入框，用户以为能改":"Putting read-only information in fields makes people think they can edit it","这段说明清楚，便于理解。":"This explanation is clear and easy to understand.","帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意……":"Make this copy more conversational while keeping the meaning…","这个组件的交互设计得很细致……":"This component’s interaction design is very thoughtful…","我想把这段话加粗，再插一张图……":"I want to bold this text and add an image…",纯文本框不支持富文本编辑:"A plain textarea doesn’t support rich-text editing","一大段只读内容放进灰框，看起来像没填完的表单":"A large block of read-only text in a gray field looks like an unfinished form","最小 1、最大 99，超出会被拦下":"Minimum 1, maximum 99; anything outside is blocked",自动保留两位小数:"Always keep two decimal places",手机号又不能加减:"You can’t increment or decrement a phone number",日期有专门的选择器:"Dates have their own picker","数值范围较大，应支持直接输入":"For a wide numeric range, support direct entry","标准配送 ":"Standard delivery ","免费 \xb7 约 3 天":"Free \xb7 about 3 days","加急配送 ":"Express delivery ","\xa58 \xb7 明天到":"\xa58 \xb7 arrives tomorrow","选项过多，难以快速比较":"Too many options are hard to compare quickly",我已阅读并同意:"I have read and agree to ","《用户协议》":"the Terms of Service","只有一个选项，不需要使用单选组":"One option doesn’t need a radio group",需要多选时应使用复选框:"Use checkboxes when more than one option can be selected",点过的单选取消不掉:"A selected radio button can’t be cleared",互斥选项不应使用复选框:"Mutually exclusive options shouldn’t use checkboxes",切换后应提供明确的生效反馈:"Show clear feedback after the change takes effect","复选框不是按钮，点它不会“提交”":"A checkbox isn’t a button; clicking it doesn’t submit","大量选项平铺，占用过多空间":"A flat list of many options takes up too much space",较强:"High","需要精确数值时，应配合数字输入框":"For exact values, pair it with a number input","只有少量离散档位时，可直接列出选项":"For a few discrete levels, list the options directly","范围跨度过大，拖动难以定位目标值":"With too wide a range, dragging can’t reliably reach the target value","7 月 12 日":"July 12",日期应使用日期选择器:"Use a date picker for dates",请为本次服务评分:"Rate this service","3.5 分":"3.5 stars",样本量与统计口径:"Sample size and methodology","♥ 赞同":"♥ Agree","只有正负反馈时，使用点赞或点踩更合适":"For simple positive or negative feedback, use like and dislike controls",推荐意愿评分:"Likelihood to recommend","选项较多且需要逐一计数时，应使用更适合的控件":"When there are many options to count individually, use a better-suited control","请说明评分原因……":"Tell us why you gave this rating…",购买数量:"Quantity",数量应使用数字输入控件:"Use a number input for quantity","高亮告诉你：现在在这儿":"The highlight shows where you are","同一页切内容，用标签页更轻":"For switching content on one page, tabs are lighter","入口全部平铺，主次层级无法辨认":"When every destination is flat, the hierarchy disappears","这是动作，不是导航":"This is an action, not navigation","入口很少时，直接展示链接更清楚":"With only a few destinations, direct links are clearer",组件库:"Component library","点「导航」直接回上一层":"Click “Navigation” to return directly to the parent level",设计组:"Design team","2026 改版":"2026 redesign",工作台:"Workspace","层级较浅时，页面标题通常已能说明位置":"With a shallow hierarchy, the page title usually shows where you are",填写信息:"Enter information",确认订单:"Confirm order",完成支付:"Complete payment","这是步骤，不是路径":"These are steps, not a path",企业版:"Enterprise",解决方案:"Solutions",零售行业:"Retail",客户案例:"Customer stories",案例详情:"Case study","七级不收缩，一行放不下":"Seven levels without truncation won’t fit on one line",当前页不应链接到自身:"The current page shouldn’t link to itself",已支付:"Paid","找到 ":"Found "," 条结果":" results","看到第 5 页，下次接着翻":"You’re on page 5, so you can pick up here next time","每页 20 条":"20 per page","内容只有一页，不需要分页控件":"One page of content doesn’t need pagination","连续浏览的信息流，被翻页操作反复打断":"Pagination repeatedly interrupts a feed meant for continuous browsing","页码全铺开，眼睛先投降":"A wall of page numbers overwhelms the eye","这是分类切换，用标签页":"This switches categories; use tabs",基本信息:"Basic information",联系方式:"Contact information",下一步:"Next","第 2 步，还差 1 步":"Step 2, one step left",创建账号:"Create account",完善资料:"Complete your profile",开始使用:"Get started","这是并列内容，用标签页":"These are peer sections; use tabs","先填哪个都行，不算步骤":"Either can be filled in first, so these aren’t steps","步骤过多会增加完成负担，应合并不必要环节":"Too many steps increase the burden; combine unnecessary ones",输入邮箱:"Enter email",输入密码:"Enter password",简单登录不需要拆成多个步骤:"A simple login doesn’t need multiple steps",更多操作:"More actions",重命名:"Rename",复制链接:"Copy link","移动到…":"Move to…",个人主页:"Profile",账号设置:"Account settings",退出登录:"Sign out",另存为:"Save as",请选择城市:"Select a city","选择一个值时，应使用选择器":"Use a select control when choosing one value","只有一个操作时，应直接展示入口":"With one action, show it directly","核心发布操作藏在“更多”中，难以发现":"A key publishing action hidden under “More” is hard to find",嵌套下拉菜单会增加定位和操作难度:"Nested menus make targeting and acting harder",快速上手:"Quick start",常见问题:"FAQ","滚到「快速上手」，目录自动高亮":"Scroll to “Quick start” and the table of contents highlights it automatically",点击后平滑滚动到对应章节:"Click to smoothly scroll to the matching section",产品特性:"Product features",客户评价:"Customer reviews","内容较短，不需要页内跳转":"Short content doesn’t need in-page navigation",定价页:"Pricing page",登录页:"Sign-in page","这些是别的页面，用链接":"These are other pages, so use links","部分 1":"Section 1","部分 2":"Section 2","部分 3":"Section 3","章节名称含糊，无法判断对应内容":"Vague section labels don’t tell people what they lead to",目录比正文还长:"The table of contents is longer than the page itself",全部状态:"All statuses",放在移动端易触及的位置:"Place it where it’s easy to reach on mobile",滚动到合适位置后出现:"Appears after you scroll far enough","页面较短，不需要返回顶部":"A short page doesn’t need a back-to-top button",不应遮挡页面主要操作:"It shouldn’t cover the page’s primary action","尺寸过小且对比度不足，按钮难以识别":"The button is too small and low-contrast to recognize","多个无关功能相邻，返回顶部入口不明确":"Several unrelated functions together make the back-to-top control unclear","图标缺少说明，用户无法确认各自作用":"Without labels, people can’t tell what the icons do","查看详情 →":"View details →","部署遇到问题？去看":"Having trouble deploying? See the ","官方文档 ↗":"official docs ↗","，回来接着操作。":", then come back and continue.","本周我们上线了三个新功能，包括全新的数据看板、支持自定义筛选的报表系统，以及重新设计的成员权限管理页面":"This week we launched three features: a new analytics dashboard, reports with custom filters, and redesigned member permissions.","想了解定价方案，":"Want to learn about pricing? ",点击这里:"Click here","；想看客户案例，":"; for customer stories, ","新版本已发布，更新日志里列出了全部改动。":"The new version is live; the release notes list every change.","“更新日志”缺少可点击样式，入口难以辨认":"“Release notes” doesn’t look clickable, so the entry point is hard to spot",页面标题:"Page title",模块标题:"Section title","正文的字号与行高要清楚易读，长文才容易持续阅读。":"Body text needs a readable size and line height for long-form reading.","官网改版 v2":"Website redesign v2","更新于 3 天前 \xb7 仅自己可见":"updated 3 days ago \xb7 visible only to you","本次更新修复了 12 个问题，其中":"This update fixed 12 issues; the ",支付流程:"payment flow","改动最大，请重点回归。":" changed the most, so test it carefully.",一级标题:"Heading 1",二级标题:"Heading 2",三级标题:"Heading 3",四级标题:"Heading 4",五级标题:"Heading 5","这是一段很重要的操作说明，但用了 10px 浅灰字，得眯着眼才能读完。":"This is an important instruction, but it uses 10px light-gray text that’s hard to read.","整段文字全部加粗后，各处权重相同，真正的重点难以辨认。":"When every word is bold, nothing reads as the real priority.","姓　　名：":"Name: ","手机号码：":"Phone: ","靠全角空格对齐，换个字体就歪":"Full-width spaces break alignment when the font changes",偏好设置:"Preferences",登录页设计:"Sign-in page design",支付流走查:"Payment-flow review",微信扫码登录:"Sign in with WeChat QR code",其他登录方式:"Other sign-in methods","拉开间距就分得清，不用加线":"More spacing makes the groups clear without adding a line",项目动态:"Project activity","卡片本身就是边界，里面别再划线":"The card is already a boundary; don’t add more lines inside it",内容和边框之间留一圈呼吸感:"Leave some breathing room between content and the border","留出清楚间隔，不挤也不分家":"Leave a clear gap: not cramped, not disconnected","间距全部相同，无法区分组内与组间关系":"Identical spacing can’t distinguish within-group from between-group relationships","按钮贴着按钮，看着就挤":"Buttons pressed together look cramped","同类按钮间距不一致，页面显得杂乱":"Inconsistent spacing between similar buttons makes the page look messy","库存　　　　42 件":"Stock: 42 units","拿全角空格凑对齐，字体一换全错位":"Using full-width spaces for alignment breaks when the font changes",首页:"Home",产品:"Product",文档:"Docs",定价:"Pricing",仪表盘:"Dashboard",项目:"Projects",成员:"Members",设置:"Settings",系统:"System",全部项目:"All projects",我负责的:"Assigned to me",概览:"Overview",数据:"Data",评论:"Comments",历史:"History",收藏:"Saved",任务:"Tasks",文件:"Files",日程: